        },
        {
          "text": "matyoonanaa, o na kũtyaaũkĩla mũndũ ũmwe kwake mĩthenya ĩtatũ: ĩndĩ ana onthe ma Isilaeli maĩ na kyeni kũla matwĩe. ",
